    "innovation": "This paper presents a comprehensive simulation (1850-2100) of Antarctic climate with the Community Earth System Model, projecting future surface mass balance increases driven by enhanced snowfall from atmospheric warming, increased oceanic evaporation, and higher summer cloud liquid water content.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
