            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "In this study we use the coupled version of the Community Earth System Model (CESM), version 1.1.2. This model uses the fifth generation of the Community Atmosphere Model [CAM5, Gettelman et al. (2010)], a land model [CLM4.5, Lawrence et al. (2011)], ocean model [POP2, Smith et al. (2010)] and sea ice model [CICE, Hunke and Lipscomb (2010)].",
